<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IT Portfolio - M.P.S.K. Senavirathna</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            background-color: #000000; 
            color: #00FF00; 
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            padding: 20px; 
            max-width: 800px; 
            margin: auto; 
        }

        .profile-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #00FF00;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid #00FF00;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00FF00;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .profile-header h1 { margin: 10px 0; color: #00FF00; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00FF00; }
        .profile-header h3 { color: #ffffff; margin: 5px 0; }

        .section-box { 
            border: 1px solid #00FF00; 
            padding: 20px; 
            margin-bottom: 25px; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            background: rgba(0, 20, 0, 0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #004400; 
        }

        #typing-text {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-right: 2px solid #00FF00;
            padding-right: 5px;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h2 { color: #00FF00; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00FF00; border-bottom: 1px solid #00FF00; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        h3 { color: #00AA00; }

        /* Rotating Neon Button Styling */
        .neon-btn {
            position: relative;
            background: #000;
            color: #00FFFF;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            overflow: hidden; 
            z-index: 1;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .neon-btn::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: conic-gradient(transparent, transparent, transparent, #00FFFF);
            animation: rotate 3s linear infinite;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .neon-btn::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 3px;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 6px;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .neon-btn:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00FFFF;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="profile-header">
        <img src="your-photo.jpg" alt="Profile Picture" class="profile-img">
        <h1>M.P.S.K. Senavirathna</h1>
        <h3>Information Technology Technician, Sri Lanka Air Force</h3>
    </div>

    <section class="section-box">
        <p id="typing-text"></p>
    </section>

    <div class="section-box">
        <h2>A- Hardware Section</h2>
        <p>During my 12 years of service in the Sri Lanka Air Force, I have directly contributed to maintaining the maximum performance and hardware reliability of computer and networking systems at an optimal level.</p>
        
        <h3>A-1: Hardware Engineering and Device Level Modification</h3>
        <p>Assembling computer systems by integrating innovative devices in accordance with system requirements and efficiently replacing damaged devices.</p>

        <h3>A-2: Operating System Installation and Driver Configuration</h3>
        <p>Installing operating systems for systems based on organizational and security requirements and correctly configuring drivers.</p>

        <h3>A-3: Software Management</h3>
        <p>To perform duties more efficiently, essential tools such as MS Office, design software, Internet browsers, and virus guards were properly installed.</p>
        
        <button class="neon-btn" onclick="openPhotoGallery()">Photo Gallery</button>
    </div>

    <div class="section-box">
        <h2>B- Network Section</h2>
        <h3>B-1: Setting up advanced networking systems</h3>
        <p>The Sri Lanka Air Force's most advanced networking systems, integrating microwaves, fiber, STP, and UTP technologies.</p>

        <h3>B-2: Fiber termination activities</h3>
        <p>As needed, new networking systems are installed and network system maintenance and troubleshooting is done.</p>

        <h3>B-3: Main Server Network Management</h3>
        <p>All the networking of the computer systems here is connected to the main networking section, and the main server computer is also connected.</p>
        
        <button class="neon-btn" onclick="openPhotoGallery()">Photo Gallery</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        const text = "During my 12 years of service in the Sri Lanka Air Force, I have served in the IT departments of many bases in the Sri Lanka Air Force, where I have repaired, maintained and installed more than 2500 computers and networking systems in each of those bases. There is an IT department in each base, which is divided into several main sections for ease of management. A-Hardware section, B-Network section, C-Software section, D-Cyber security section, E-Multimedia section. I have served in all the sections and have complete knowledge of each section.";
        
        let index = 0;
        function typeWriter() {
            if (index < text.length) {
                document.getElementById("typing-text").innerHTML += text.charAt(index);
                index++;
                setTimeout(typeWriter, 30);
            }
        }
        
        window.onload = typeWriter;

        function openPhotoGallery() {
            alert("Photo Gallery: This section showcases visual evidence of my technical work and projects.");
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>